<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts Apple.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts Apple.</headline>
<text>
<p>--  Prudential cut Apple Computer Inc to hold from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Don Young was not available to comment immediately.</p>
</text>
